  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1639420,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. for your sake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1640920,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And usually memories like that, good memories tend to stay,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1645420,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess that's how it is."
